     The hhaasshhiinniitt() and pphhaasshhiinniitt() functions will panic if argument _n_e_l_e_m_e_n_t_s
     is less than or equal to zero.

     The hhaasshhddeessttrrooyy() function will panic if the hash table pointed to by
     _h_a_s_h_t_b_l is not empty.

